WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.616
This example trims the email removes characters
outside a teaching-level allowed set and converts

00:00:05.629 --> 00:00:11.649
the result to lowercase Run it and compare original
and cleaned values

00:00:13.487 --> 00:00:19.556
Notice that cleaning a string does not prove the
result is valid Transformation

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:25.355
and validation are separate steps That distinction
is important in data

00:00:25.368 --> 00:00:26.170
preparation
